ge snapshot completion remains meaningful because it represents committed state. reset clears election votes, replication progress and read-only tracking while retaining the log; becomeLeader appends a current-term empty entry and conservatively delays configuration proposals behind its inherited log tail. Configuration application changes the voter tracker used by both formation and elections. Application completion is distinct from durability: MsgStorageApplyResp is term-independent and carries applied entries; ordinary RawNode.Advance dispatches precomputed completion messages, and heartbeat-only Ready batches do not manufacture application acknowledgments. Early surface: tracker.Config.AutoLeave documents implementation-owned automatic transition when possible. raft.appliedTo attempts the empty configuration proposal; stepLeader rejects proposals during leadership transfer. Its comment expects a next advance after failed transfer, but tickHeartbeat timeout only calls abortLeaderTransfer, whose body clears leadTransferee without scheduling another attempt. These are source observations and a retry premise, not a demonstrated violation.', 'remaining':['Complete the initial core overview by tracing actual campaign vote aggregation, follower append matching/commit consumption, snapshot restore, log persistence reconstruction and configuration changer validation; current learning is not yet a usable full map.','Investigate the automatic-joint-exit surface: can a legal Ready/application schedule place the only required exit attempt during leadership transfer, followed by transfer timeout without further unapplied entries? Inspect caller completion duties, existing tests and all alternative retry triggers before constructing an execution.','An independent surface in switchToConfig: maybeCommit can advance commitment and broadcast without the releasePendingReadIndexMessages call used by MsgAppResp. Determine whether a legal history can have pending read requests at that point and whether another consumer necessarily releases them. No lost request is established.'], 'rationale':'Save precise producer/consumer distinctions and unresolved discrepancies early. Storage ordering and term filtering are counterevidence against treating delayed acknowledgments as immediately unsafe. Automatic exit can succeed at ordinary application completion or after a new leader appends and applies its empty entry; neither observation answers the failed-transfer-with-no-new-application premise.'}}\nopen('submission.json','w').write(json.dumps(p,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nPY\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-05_08-31-36-etcd_raft-real-run --submission submission.json\"","aggregated_output":"{\"valid\": false, \"run_id\": \"e341bd5385004f23a51456f52bf58029\", \"audit_spec_version\": 0, \"elapsed_seconds\": 1.241285390999991, \"diagnostics\": [{\"details\": {}, \"code\": \"submission\", \"category\": \"semantic\", \"task\": \"\", \"candidate_version\": 0, \"object_ids\": [], \"paths\": [], \"material_ids\": [], \"message\": \"Submission file is missing or escapes the draft directory\", \"allowed\": []}], \"meaning\": \"Validation against the state and bytes read; this is not acceptance, execution or evidence\"}\n","exit_code":2,"status":"failed"}}
